<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Radio Demon's Lover</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;For many years, Etheria and Hell have been at war. King Lucifer has chosen a powerful sinner, The Radio Demon, to find an Etherian and have a betrothed wedding to restore peace between the two worlds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And the Radio Demon seem to have found the perfect companion: a shapeshifter who, little does he know, is quite the killer. Figuratively AND literally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Said shapeshifter never wanted anything to do with him, but the tables turn throughout the process.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Chaotic_Desires</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
